@page "/stream-blocking"

<PageTitle>Stream rendering (blocking)</PageTitle>

<section class="stream-demo">
    <h1>Without <code>[StreamRendering]</code></h1>
    <p>
        Same component as the streamed page, no attribute. The server waits
        for the whole <code>OnInitializedAsync</code> to finish before sending
        any HTML &mdash; expect a blank tab for ~3 seconds, then everything appears at once.
    </p>

    <a class="toggle-link" href="/stream">
        → see the same component <strong>with</strong> [StreamRendering]
    </a>

    <StreamSections />
</section>

<RenderModeBadge />
